Game idea
Rougelike in dark fantasy style (2d)
Some amount of lvl's and different boime's (locations)
Mobs and bosses
upgradable stuff (weapons/artifacts etc)
skills(perks)
more of vertical maps that goes deeper and harder with every depth lvl


Idea of character developemnet
Strenght of player increases by consuming corruption in world after some important events(i.e boss fights)



lore idea
World shattered under the wrath of the four horseman ( hunger , plague , war , and death)   ...
whole world consumed by wars
main character with his brothers fightin in a huge battle against their enemies, his brother shields protaginist from the sword with his body,and dies on protagonist hands
Then main character decides to get back his brother from the underworld and give his soul to death to ressurect his brother.

